  "p3": {
    "narration": "They tested eight surfactants, bought ninety nine per cent pure, with different tails and heads. Their micelle thresholds span two orders of magnitude. One of them is SDS. Another study measured its threshold at twenty five degrees, with no salt added: eight point two three, in millimolar units.",
